  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Protection Risks of Refugees and Migrants through Mobility and Needs Assessment Monitoring and Direct Assistance in Indonesia, Malaysia, and Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to strengthening protection of refugees, including but not limited to Rohingya and Myanmar refugees and migrants, through mobility and needs assessment monitoring and direct humanitarian assistance in Indonesia, Malaysia and Thailand.</narrative>
  </description>
